            "text": "Stored XSS via unauthenticated SVG contributor upload\n\nThe unauthenticated contributor submission accepts an SVG containing active script and serves it back inline as `image/svg+xml`. When a user opens the uploaded file, the script executes in the application origin, enabling arbitrary same-origin browser actions."
